      <p class="related-resources-title">Additional resources</p>
      <ul>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/operators/understanding/olm/olm-colocation#olm-colocation">Operator Lifecycle Manager (OLM) → Multitenancy and Operator colocation</a></li>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/operators/understanding/olm-multitenancy#olm-multitenancy">Operators in multitenant clusters</a></li>
